<title>ITALY: Ambroveneto shares go limit-up in Milan.</title>
<headline>Ambroveneto shares go limit-up in Milan.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares in Ambroveneto was suspended temporarily on Monday after they went limit-up on the bourse.</p>
<p>Trading in the stock was halted when Ambroveneto was quoted at 7,375 lire in early afternoon after closing on Friday at 6,707 lire. Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
